            arrive through the npm tarballs, but this artifact is still the SOLE carrier for the
            33 transitive org.openidentityplatform.commons.ui.libs dependencies that dir.xml's
            dependencySet blocks consume (25 js, 6 css, 1 less, 1 zip). The npm packages ship no
            libs/ directory at all, so removing this empties the shipped /libs. It is also still
            unpacked, narrowly, by unpack-forgerock-ui-user-form2js below. Retires in task 4.7
            together with those dependencySet blocks.
        -->
